trial1:
Final Answers

- **Sum of the first \( n \) terms**:
  \[
  S_n = 9 \times \left(1 - \left(\frac{2}{3}\right)^n\right)
  \]

- **Sum of the first 5 terms**:
  \[
  S_5 = \frac{211}{27}
  \]

\[
\boxed{
\begin{aligned}
&\text{Sum of first } n \text{ terms:} \\
&S_n = 9(1 - (\frac{2}{3})^n) \\
&\text{Sum of first 5 terms:} \\
&S_5 = \frac{211}{27}
\end{aligned}
}
\]

